Umbrel home-screen widget for Kanzo.

Adds GET /api/widget, a small JSON endpoint in the shape Umbrel's
"four-stats" widget expects: task counts for Todo, Doing, Review and Done.
Umbrel fetches it server-side from the container, outside its app proxy.
